WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:16.253
The next weekend my friends and I climbed aboard a big luxury bus.

2
00:00:16.254 --> 00:00:19.666
We were headed for our mountain getaway with Mr. Chen.

3
00:00:19.667 --> 00:00:21.937
Bunch came too, of course.

4
00:00:21.938 --> 00:00:24.896
But he had to travel in his dog cage.

5
00:00:24.897 --> 00:00:27.172
We found seats on the bus.

6
00:00:27.173 --> 00:00:31.292
All around us, lots of people were talking and laughing.

7
00:00:31.293 --> 00:00:35.756
I guess we weren't the only ones excited about a mountain getaway!

8
00:00:35.757 --> 00:00:38.358
Caswell was sitting next to Molly.

9
00:00:38.359 --> 00:00:42.250
He had his huge teddy bear backpack with him.

10
00:00:42.251 --> 00:00:45.588
"Are we there yet?" he asked her.

11
00:00:45.589 --> 00:00:48.411
"Caswell, the bus hasn't even left yet,"

12
00:00:48.412 --> 00:00:53.026
said Molly, laughing at her little brother.

13
00:00:53.028 --> 00:00:56.321
"So how could we be there already?"

14
00:00:56.322 --> 00:01:00.774
The bus finally pulled out of the station a few minutes later.

15
00:01:00.775 --> 00:01:04.743
I smiled to myself and patted my backpack.

16
00:01:04.744 --> 00:01:10.563
Besides my clothes, the backpack contained my secret invention.

17
00:01:10.564 --> 00:01:15.559
From inside his dog cage, Bunch kept sniffing the air.

18
00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:20.707
He could probably smell the hamster pellets I had used for my invention.

19
00:01:20.708 --> 00:01:23.609
Bunch loves hamster pellets.

20
00:01:23.610 --> 00:01:26.051
He was even drooling!

21
00:01:26.052 --> 00:01:31.142
Mr. Chen had brought a big suitcase that held his magic tricks.

22
00:01:31.143 --> 00:01:37.044
When he wasn't working at the supermarket, Mr. Chen sometimes performed magic shows.

23
00:01:37.045 --> 00:01:41.775
Once I'd seen him make a frog leap out of his shirt sleeve.

24
00:01:41.776 --> 00:01:45.075
The audience had loved that trick.

25
00:01:45.076 --> 00:01:47.913
Molly had noticed the suitcase too.

26
00:01:47.914 --> 00:01:52.832
"Mr. Chen, can we see your magic things?" she asked.

27
00:01:52.833 --> 00:01:56.315
"Sure," said Mr. Chen with a smile.

28
00:01:56.316 --> 00:01:58.543
"I'm working on some new tricks.

29
00:01:58.544 --> 00:02:02.193
I'm going to practice them at Shadow Lake Lodge."

30
00:02:02.194 --> 00:02:05.866
He took his suitcase down from the overhead rack.

31
00:02:05.867 --> 00:02:08.136
He showed us some of the things inside:

32
00:02:08.137 --> 00:02:13.559
gold coins, playing cards, and a magic wand.

33
00:02:13.560 --> 00:02:17.484
"Are we there yet?" Caswell kept asking.

34
00:02:17.485 --> 00:02:20.341
Molly covered her face with her hands.

35
00:02:20.342 --> 00:02:23.224
But Josh smiled patiently.

36
00:02:23.225 --> 00:02:25.948
"Not yet, Caswell," he said.

37
00:02:25.949 --> 00:02:32.960
"But we're going into a cool tunnel now!"

38
00:02:32.961 --> 00:02:37.121
"This tunnel goes under a river," I added.

39
00:02:37.122 --> 00:02:41.535
Caswell peered nervously through the window.

40
00:02:41.536 --> 00:02:46.638
"I hope the river doesn't fall on our heads," he said.

41
00:02:46.639 --> 00:02:50.059
"Don't worry, Caswell," said Mr. Chen.

42
00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:51.706
"This tunnel is strong.

43
00:02:51.707 --> 00:02:54.072
It will keep the river out."

44
00:02:54.073 --> 00:03:00.455
When we came out of the tunnel, we were not in the city anymore.

45
00:03:00.456 --> 00:03:03.115
We were on a busy highway.

46
00:03:03.116 --> 00:03:08.464
In the distance I could see hills with colorful fall trees.

47
00:03:08.465 --> 00:03:14.620
An hour later the bus was climbing a steep mountain road.

48
00:03:14.621 --> 00:03:22.623
It led up to Shadow Lake Lodge.

49
00:03:22.624 --> 00:03:26.200
"Oh my gosh!" Jenny gasped.

50
00:03:26.201 --> 00:03:30.211
"This is where we're staying?" said Josh.

51
00:03:30.212 --> 00:03:37.173
"Caswell, guess what," Molly whispered. "We're finally here."

52
00:03:37.174 --> 00:03:41.428
I was staring at the building in amazement too.

53
00:03:41.429 --> 00:03:46.733
I decided that Shadow Lake Lodge wasn't really a hotel.

54
00:03:46.734 --> 00:03:50.775
It was a fairy-tale castle sitting on a mountain.

55
00:03:50.776 --> 00:03:54.224
Flags flew from its towers.

56
00:03:54.225 --> 00:03:57.269
Hills rippled below.

57
00:03:57.270 --> 00:04:02.334
A blue lake glittered in the sunlight.

58
00:04:02.335 --> 00:04:05.960
"I can't wait to see our room!" said Molly.

59
00:04:05.961 --> 00:04:10.029
"Maybe it will have gold curtains."

60
00:04:10.030 --> 00:04:13.764
"And diamond tables," said Jenny.

61
00:04:13.765 --> 00:04:18.866
Molly giggled. "We'll be like princesses!"

62
00:04:18.867 --> 00:04:26.002
"Maybe we'll be invited to a fancy ball tonight," said Jenny.

63
00:04:26.003 --> 00:04:27.543
Josh gave me a look.

64
00:04:27.544 --> 00:04:30.905
The look meant, "Ugh! Girls."

65
00:04:30.906 --> 00:04:33.507
I knew just how he felt.

66
00:04:33.508 --> 00:04:37.769
I didn't care about gold curtains or diamond tables either.

67
00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:42.081
And I definitely didn't care about fancy balls.

68
00:04:42.082 --> 00:04:46.280
"I want to hike up to that lookout tower," I said.

69
00:04:46.281 --> 00:04:52.452
I pointed to a tall stone tower at the very top of the mountain.

70
00:04:52.453 --> 00:04:56.223
"Me too!" cried Josh.

71
00:04:56.224 --> 00:04:59.546
I had never climbed a mountain before.

72
00:04:59.547 --> 00:05:05.844
I patted my backpack again, really glad that I had brought along my latest invention.

73
00:05:05.845 --> 00:05:13.499
Looking up at the steep mountain, I had a feeling that we were going to need my invention.
